  "title": "z-planelandscape of Im F, both sheetslandscape",
  "cap": "The landscape of $F(z)=\\sin\\left(\\sqrt{z}\\right)$ over the $z$-plane: the height is $\\operatorname{Im} F$ and the colour $\\arg F$ (bar); both sheets are shown. Here $F=f_{2}\\circ f_{1}$ with $f_{1}(z)=\\sqrt{z}$ and $f_{2}(w)=\\sin w$. On its natural domain $D=\\{z : \\arg z\\neq -90^\\circ\\}$, $F$ is analytic; this is guaranteed by the chain.",
